  <title>Limitations</title>

  <p>Griabuntu Mail is still in early development. Griabuntu Mail supports IMAP and has
  been tested with Gmail, Yahoo, and the free Dovecot mail server.
  Experimental support for Outlook.com is provided.  Griabuntu Mail may not yet
  work well with some IMAP servers.  At this time Griabuntu Mail is still
  missing numerous features including offline mode.</p>

  <p>To learn more about the features we're working on and the future
  of Griabuntu Mail, please visit Griabuntu Mail's <link
  href="https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Geary">wiki page</link>.</p>

</page>
